 Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter I — \"The Thomistic problem\"#{6}":[55,56],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"":[57,63],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{1}":[59,59],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{2}":[60,60],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{3}":[61,61],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{4}":[62,63],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Pages created from this source":[64,68],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Pages created from this source#{1}":[66,66],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Pages created from this source#{2}":[67,68],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest":[69,72],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest#{1}":[71,72],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Raw File":[73,76],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Raw File#{1}":[75,76]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Étienne Gilson","target":"Étienne Gilson","line":13},{"title":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","target":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","line":14},{"title":"Tomismo","target":"Tomismo","line":15},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":16},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":17},{"title":"Étienne Gilson","target":"Étienne Gilson","line":66},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":67},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":71},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":71},{"title":"god-philosophy-universities","target":"god-philosophy-universities","line":71}],"metadata":{"type":"source","title":"Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin","address":"c-000032","created":"2026-07-25","updated":"2026-07-25","tags":["#tomismo","#source","#book"],"status":"developing","related":["[[Étienne Gilson]]","[[San Tommaso d'Aquino]]","[[Tomismo]]","[[Dottrina di Atto e Potenza]]","[[Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia]]"],"source_type":"book","author":"Étienne Gilson","date_published":"1919 (1st ed., based on 1913-14 Lille lectures); 1922 (2nd ed., this scan)","url":"","confidence":"high","key_claims":["Aquinas's philosophical project is best understood as the solution to a specific 13th-century historical conflict — the 'Thomistic problem' — between Latin Averroism (Siger of Brabant) and Augustinian-Franciscan Platonism (Bonaventure): to 'christianize Aristotle' by walking a narrow ridge between the two.","The entire Thomistic system is woven from a small number of principles, all aspects of a single idea, being — from which the convertibility of being, unity, truth, and goodness follows.","The universe is a hierarchy of participation in divine being, held together by analogy (not univocity), which is precisely what distinguishes this cosmos from Neo-Platonic emanationism: 'the world is an ordered discontinuity,' not a continuous overflow from the One."],"raw_file":".raw/E. Gilson - Le Thomisme. Introduction au Système de Saint Thomas D'aquin.pdf"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Wiki/sources/le-thomisme-gilson.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"12k3tt4","at":1785014026854},"key":"Wiki/sources/le-thomisme-gilson.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,28],"size":1415,"outlinks":[{"title":"Étienne Gilson","target":"Étienne Gilson","line":13},{"title":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","target":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","line":14},{"title":"Tomismo","target":"Tomismo","line":15},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":16},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":17}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
