ntroduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter I — \"The Thomistic problem\"#{2}":[51,51],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter I — \"The Thomistic problem\"#{3}":[52,52],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter I — \"The Thomistic problem\"#{4}":[53,53],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter I — \"The Thomistic problem\"#{5}":[54,54],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter I — \"The Thomistic problem\"#{6}":[55,56],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"":[57,63],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{1}":[59,59],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{2}":[60,60],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{3}":[61,61],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Chapter XV — \"The spirit of Thomism\"#{4}":[62,63],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Pages created from this source":[64,68],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Pages created from this source#{1}":[66,66],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Pages created from this source#{2}":[67,68],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest":[69,72],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest#{1}":[71,72],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Raw File":[73,76],"#Source: Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin#Raw File#{1}":[75,76]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Étienne Gilson","target":"Étienne Gilson","line":13},{"title":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","target":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","line":14},{"title":"Tomismo","target":"Tomismo","line":15},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":16},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":17},{"title":"Étienne Gilson","target":"Étienne Gilson","line":66},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":67},{"title":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","target":"Dottrina di Atto e Potenza","line":71},{"title":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","target":"Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia","line":71},{"title":"god-philosophy-universities","target":"god-philosophy-universities","line":71}],"metadata":{"type":"source","title":"Le Thomisme: Introduction au système de Saint Thomas d'Aquin","address":"c-000032","created":"2026-07-25","updated":"2026-07-25","tags":["#tomismo","#source","#book"],"status":"developing","related":["[[Étienne Gilson]]","[[San Tommaso d'Aquino]]","[[Tomismo]]","[[Dottrina di Atto e Potenza]]","[[Gerarchia degli Esseri e Analogia]]"],"source_type":"book","author":"Étienne Gilson","date_published":"1919 (1st ed., based on 1913-14 Lille lectures); 1922 (2nd ed., this scan)","url":"","confidence":"high","key_claims":["Aquinas's philosophical project is best understood as the solution to a specific 13th-century historical conflict — the 'Thomistic problem' — between Latin Averroism (Siger of Brabant) and Augustinian-Franciscan Platonism (Bonaventure): to 'christianize Aristotle' by walking a narrow ridge between the two.","The entire Thomistic system is woven from a small number of principles, all aspects of a single idea, being — from which the convertibility of being, unity, truth, and goodness follows.","The universe is a hierarchy of participation in divine being, held together by analogy (not univocity), which is precisely what distinguishes this cosmos from Neo-Platonic emanationism: 'the world is an ordered discontinuity,' not a continuous overflow from the One."],"raw_file":".raw/E. Gilson - Le Thomisme. Introduction au Système de Saint Thomas D'aquin.pdf"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Wiki/sources/le-thomisme-gilson.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"12k3tt4","at":1785014068751},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02859431,-0.03720651,-0.00343663,0.01869529,-0.03527335,-0.04784475,-0.07158151,0.07481445,0.02961948,0.05206308,0.01469546,-0.03650764,0.04042415,0.04398562,0.0865551,0.0013289,-0.02508475,0.08761389,-0.02903625,-0.00279163,0.11296717,-0.03662572,-0.05548162,-0.04165786,0.03376301,0.09780712,0.01915821,-0.04778785,-0.02472863,-0.19836228,-0.02332347,0.03156389,0.01341859,-0.0333351,0.01553353,-0.00942906,-0.02335422,-0.03544307,-0.04153857,0.09330051,0.01383244,0.06261094,0.01848003,-0.01640282,-0.03819051,0.03201295,-0.01646098,0.02822938,-0.06027925,-0.05689102,-0.08286771,0.05087277,-0.02961667,-0.01974616,-0.00442664,0.08160722,0.03285007,0.08631669,0.02535748,0.00796024,0.04844536,0.02509443,-0.21988165,0.11189684,0.07022927,0.03242548,-0.03613827,-0.01868793,-0.00311768,-0.03941219,-0.02104413,-0.01402695,0.00770835,0.04603541,0.07926454,-0.00834008,0.04152748,-0.03069399,-0.02316402,-0.02031377,0.03454763,0.06826921,-0.05072956,0.00826386,-0.06721082,0.0150735,-0.0367015,0.00383387,0.02222685,-0.06148269,-0.04469346,-0.04736141,0.02571307,0.03570439,0.01430363,-0.03731811,-0.01450741,0.03916227,0.01234226,0.06192006,0.01918114,0.02821144,0.06439701,0.02106308,0.03772057,-0.01120016,-0.05160829,-0.12510772,-0.02327413,-0.00918727,-0.00773921,-0.0387684,-0.00628886,-0.06632807,0.05559788,-0.01897872,0.06543719,-0.0010021,0.02106636,0.02564915,-0.04019485,0.02734518,0.05284052,-0.03286019,0.00699501,-0.05699725,-0.00048162,0.01846516,0.06044133,0.00847328,0.03695088,0.03231737,-0.04316537,-0.0206443,-0.01744804,-0.0072618,-0.02525237,